# Docker :

# Typical Env : Server - hypervisor - Virtual Machines = Not all disk space is used by the application and someone needs to manage this infrastructure.

# Container can be hosted on 2 Environments :
1) Server - Hypervisor - Virtual Machine - VM OS - Docker runtime - Container 
2) Server - OS - Docker Runtime - Container 

# Containers are light weight systems that use the the host OS and run the applications . 

# Container has both application and system dependencies which are packages from a file to an image and then to a container using the Docker runtimet to manage them

